### List all products (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/productcatalog

### Create a product as an administrator
POST {{baseUrl}}/productcatalog
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAuthToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "HW-WATCH-FIT3-001",
